# Docker build context for deploy/fuseki/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Allow-list: exclude everything (docs/paper holds large zips), then re-include
# only what the image loads or needs to build.
*
!hcmo.yaml
!dist/hcmo.ttl
!examples/*.ttl
!vocabularies/*.ttl
!docs/hcm-systems/catalog.ttl
!deploy/fuseki/**
